                <invention-title lang="de">PIXELSCHALTUNG UND ANSTEUERUNGSVERFAHREN DAFÜR, ANZEIGETAFEL UND ANZEIGEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CIRCUIT DE PIXEL ET SON PROCÉDÉ D'ATTAQUE, PANNEAU D'AFFICHAGE ET DISPOSITIF D'AFFICHAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PIXEL CIRCUIT AND DRIVING METHOD THEREFOR, DISPLAY PANEL, AND DISPLAY DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A pixel circuit (101) includes a driving circuit (30), a first control circuit (10) and a second control circuit (20). The driving circuit (30) is configured to receive a data signal in response to a scan signal, and generate, in response to a first enable signal, a driving signal according to a first voltage and the data signal. The first control circuit (10) is configured to: receive a first input signal in response to a first control signal, and transmit a third input signal in response to the first input signal; and receive a second input signal in response to a second control signal, and transmit a second enable signal in response to the second input signal. The second control circuit (20) is configured to transmit the driving signal to an element (L) to be driven in response to one of the third input signal and the second enable signal.</p>
            </abstract>
